{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Z6_Text_art_2.png?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone 6 is a 1 -4 player narrative exploration game which can be played alone, or with friends.\u00a0 <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Zone6_City_2.gif?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A neon-lit metropolis in the middle of a frosty wasteland, where battered technology, stray magic, and faction rivalries entwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Zone6_Dogs_1.gif?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose 1 up to 4 of the indebted adventurers trying to escape their past mistakes which forces them out into the dangerous wasteland in hopes of clearing their debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Zone6_Creature_1.gif?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the creatures lurking about while venturing into the icy frontier haunted by unknown entities, where each discovery carries a grave risk of corrupted power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Zone6_Stone_1.gif?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world, where actions might have consequences...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813590/extras/Z6_Text_PurpleStanding_1.png?t=1742923263\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mediocre artwork by non award-winning Ullbors. (TABS, TABG, Stick Fight and ROUNDS)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack by Jussi Edefors, created while doing book keeping for clients. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Programming by Tony Backman, while secretly working on a boardgame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Art by Myra Hild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rock bottom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/1f38ad0d39a0ee582e275981f5e8271eaba9b124.jpg"},{"name":"Knower of 1 Thing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/6206cc7e17c483168eac1eb200e277e1540d48e8.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of all stats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/2fbd76abfd702af00f3651f9176d79099b259d1c.jpg"},{"name":"Snaked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/01caf66c6503431cac046c4db5d047917b943d58.jpg"},{"name":"Pummeld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/17a25f127221833f119a2049403d2534d14bcf14.jpg"},{"name":"Sliced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/28dce48413d45976c2e44fe671ebe56a6167f953.jpg"},{"name":"Maxi bonk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/a9e10bd05090e477771c70aec2302566fb47b5a7.jpg"},{"name":"Cooked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/1b271bfdd2333ebec9a84cdb909767cdf1e507ef.jpg"},{"name":"Frankendead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/027539458392c3ad7b814ed14c7cda8f9bab19e4.jpg"},{"name":"Lose Rivet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2813590/133458e357d34c10086f26b47a58a96e6839d639.jpg"}